{"id": "ab6d1053-3504-4e5a-b154-1ed1c97bab30", "slug": "eco-tech-dashboard", "title": "Eco-Tech Dashboard", "description": "Eco Tech Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Eco-Tech Dashboard\"\ndescription: \"Eco Tech Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#B6CC9D\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#A1B887\"\n  background: \"#CED1C3\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#8C9680\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Gloock\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"32px\"\n  control: \"31px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Eco-Tech Dashboard\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 221; favorites: 7; remixes: 3.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, bento, charts, navigation.\n## Overview\nEco Tech Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nEco-Tech Workshops Schedule 18k+ Global participants 88% Success rate Instructor Module Level Date Time Liam Moss Systems Ecologist Sustainable Systems Intermediate 14.11.2023 09:00-11:00 Emma Grove Lead Architect Green…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Eco-Tech Workshops Schedule; Cultivate knowledge organically.; Weekly Engagement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #B6CC9D, secondary #000000, accent #A1B887, background #CED1C3, surface #191C21, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Gloock for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Eco-Tech Dashboard</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-gloock\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gloock&display=swap\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-gloock\">\n        .font-gloock { font-family: 'Gloock', serif !important; }\n        .font-sans { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#ced1c3] min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8 font-sans antialiased text-gray-800 flex items-center justify-center selection:bg-[#8DA374] selection:text-white\">\n\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1100px] mx-auto flex flex-col gap-6 relative z-10\">\n        \n        <!-- Top Card: Hero Section / Classes Table -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-[32px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/60 to-white/10 opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 ease-out js-reveal\">\n            <!-- Beautiful lg shadow applied to this hero surface -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#fcfcf9] rounded-[31px] p-6 md:p-8 shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] overflow-hidden\">\n                \n                <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-8 gap-6\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-2xl tracking-tight leading-snug w-64 text-[#2d3329] font-gloock\" id=\"title-anim\">\n                        Eco-Tech Workshops Schedule\n                    </h1>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 text-sm\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <span class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[#3d4734] font-sans\">18k+</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[#6b7561] leading-tight w-20 text-xs font-sans\">Global participants</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-px h-10 bg-[#e0e3d5]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <span class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[#3d4734] font-sans\">88%</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[#6b7561] leading-tight w-20 text-xs font-sans\">Success rate</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Table Header -->\n                <div class=\"hidden md:grid grid-cols-[1.8fr_1.5fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_auto] gap-4 px-4 pb-3 text-xs font-normal text-[#8c9680]\">\n                    <div class=\"font-sans\">Instructor</div>\n                    <div class=\"font-sans\">Module</div>\n                    <div class=\"font-sans\">Level</div>\n                    <div class=\"font-sans\">Date</div>\n                    <div class=\"font-sans\">Time</div>\n                    <div></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Table Rows -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Row 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.8fr_1.5fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_auto] gap-y-4 gap-x-4 items-center bg-[#f2f4ec] p-3 md:px-4 md:py-3 rounded-2xl md:rounded-full transition-colors hover:bg-[#e9ebdf] opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 ease-out js-reveal\" style=\"transition-delay: 100ms;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=47\" alt=\"Liam Moss\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover grayscale opacity-80 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-[#2d3329] font-sans\">Liam Moss</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs text-[#6b7561] font-sans\">Systems Ecologist</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm text-[#4d5744] font-normal font-sans\">Sustainable Systems</div>\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-[#5e6b52] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] font-sans border border-[#e0e3d5]/50\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                Intermediate\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#5e6b52] font-sans\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680] md:hidden\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            14.11.2023\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#5e6b52] font-sans\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            09:00-11:00\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"text-[#8c9680] hover:text-[#5e6b52] transition-colors hidden md:block\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Row 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.8fr_1.5fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_auto] gap-y-4 gap-x-4 items-center bg-white p-3 md:px-4 md:py-3 rounded-2xl md:rounded-full transition-colors hover:bg-[#fafbf8] opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 ease-out js-reveal\" style=\"transition-delay: 200ms;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=11\" alt=\"Emma Grove\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover grayscale opacity-80 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-[#2d3329] font-sans\">Emma Grove</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs text-[#6b7561] font-sans\">Lead Architect</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm text-[#4d5744] font-normal font-sans\">Green Architecture</div>\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-[#5e6b52] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] border border-[#e0e3d5]/50 font-sans\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-up-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                Advanced\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#5e6b52] font-sans\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680] md:hidden\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            16.11.2023\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#5e6b52] font-sans\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            11:00-13:00\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"text-[#8c9680] hover:text-[#5e6b52] transition-colors hidden md:block\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Row 3 -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.8fr_1.5fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_auto] gap-y-4 gap-x-4 items-center bg-[#f2f4ec] p-3 md:px-4 md:py-3 rounded-2xl md:rounded-full transition-colors hover:bg-[#e9ebdf] opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 ease-out js-reveal\" style=\"transition-delay: 300ms;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=68\" alt=\"Noah Fern\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover grayscale opacity-80 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-[#2d3329] font-sans\">Noah Fern</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs text-[#6b7561] font-sans\">Energy Consultant</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm text-[#4d5744] font-normal font-sans\">Renewable Energy</div>\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-[#5e6b52] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] font-sans border border-[#e0e3d5]/50\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-2-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                Beginner\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#5e6b52] font-sans\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680] md:hidden\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            19.11.2023\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#5e6b52] font-sans\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            14:00-16:00\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"text-[#8c9680] hover:text-[#5e6b52] transition-colors hidden md:block\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Row 4 -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.8fr_1.5fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_auto] gap-y-4 gap-x-4 items-center bg-white p-3 md:px-4 md:py-3 rounded-2xl md:rounded-full transition-colors hover:bg-[#fafbf8] opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 ease-out js-reveal\" style=\"transition-delay: 400ms;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=44\" alt=\"Ava Reed\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover grayscale opacity-80 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-[#2d3329] font-sans\">Ava Reed</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs text-[#6b7561] font-sans\">Data Scientist</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm text-[#4d5744] font-normal font-sans\">Eco-Data Analysis</div>\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-[#5e6b52] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] border border-[#e0e3d5]/50 font-sans\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-up-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                Intermediate\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#5e6b52] font-sans\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680] md:hidden\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            22.11.2023\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#5e6b52] font-sans\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" class=\"text-[#8c9680]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            16:00-18:00\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"text-[#8c9680] hover:text-[#5e6b52] transition-colors hidden md:block\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] gap-6\">\n            \n            <!-- Bottom Left Card: Ethereal Utility Visualization -->\n            <!-- Beautiful md shadow and border gradient applied -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-[32px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#4d5744] to-transparent opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 ease-out js-reveal shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\" style=\"transition-delay: 200ms;\">\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#0d120d] rounded-[31px] p-8 overflow-hidden min-h-[380px] flex flex-col justify-between h-full group\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Deep-space background aura -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_70%_50%,_rgba(26,38,24,0.8)_0%,_rgba(0,0,0,1)_100%)] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Canvas 3D Network Sphere -->\n                    <canvas id=\"network-globe\" class=\"absolute top-0 right-[-20%] md:right-[-10%] bottom-0 w-[80%] md:w-[60%] h-full z-10 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n                    <!-- Spatial Data Indicators (Driven by JS) -->\n                    <div id=\"float-chip\" class=\"absolute z-20 pointer-events-auto opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-out\" style=\"transform: translate(0,0);\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n                            <div class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                                <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-white opacity-75\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-white\"></span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-white/90 text-xs tracking-wider font-sans font-light\">Node Active</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"float-callout\" class=\"absolute z-20 pointer-events-auto opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-out\" style=\"transform: translate(0,0);\">\n                        <div class=\"relative bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-2.5 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] w-28\">\n                            <div class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-sans mb-1\">Efficiency</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-white text-sm font-medium font-sans\">98.4% <span class=\"text-[#8DA374]\">↑</span></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Content Overlay -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-30 flex flex-col h-full justify-between pointer-events-auto\">\n                        <!-- Logo -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-8\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-linear\" class=\"text-[#8DA374] text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-white/90 font-light tracking-tight font-sans\">EcoSphere</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Title -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto mb-10 md:mb-16\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white/95 tracking-tight leading-[1.1] font-gloock font-light\" id=\"master-anim\">\n                                Cultivate<br>\n                                knowledge<br>\n                                organically.\n                            </h2>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- CTA area -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-full p-1.5 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-white/20 hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] transition-all\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </button>\n                                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-white/20 hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] transition-all\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-white/50 font-light leading-tight font-sans tracking-wide\">\n                                Join the network<br>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white/80 hover:text-white hover:underline underline-offset-4 decoration-white/20 transition-colors font-sans\">on ecosphere.io</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Right Card: Progress Chart -->\n            <!-- Beautiful md shadow applied -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-[32px] bg-[#8DA374] p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 ease-out js-reveal relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"transition-delay: 300ms;\">\n                \n                <!-- Background ambient glow -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-[#a1b887] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50 pointer-events-none translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/3\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Header -->\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8 relative z-10\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight text-[#1e2617] font-gloock\">Weekly Engagement</h3>\n                    \n                    <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n                    <div class=\"flex bg-[#a1b887] rounded-full p-1 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] select-none text-xs font-medium border border-[#b6cc9d]/30\">\n                        <div class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#2d3b23] text-[#eef2e8] cursor-default font-sans shadow-sm\">7D</div>\n                        <div class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[#3d4f2f] hover:text-[#1e2617] cursor-pointer transition-colors font-sans\">30D</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Chart Area -->\n                <div class=\"relative h-48 w-full flex-grow mt-auto flex items-end justify-between px-2 z-10\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Background Grid Lines -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex justify-between px-6 pointer-events-none opacity-20\">\n                        <div class=\"h-full border-l border-dashed border-[#2d3b23]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full border-l border-dashed border-[#2d3b23]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full border-l border-dashed border-[#2d3b23]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full border-l border-dashed border-[#2d3b23]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"h-full border-l border-dashed border-[#2d3b23]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Day 1 (Mon) -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 w-10 relative z-10 group\">\n                        <div class=\"relative w-8 h-[120px] bg-[#a1b887] rounded-full overflow-hidden transition-transform group-hover:scale-105 border border-[#b6cc9d]/20\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full h-[60%] bg-[#4f663c] rounded-b-full\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#3d4f2f] font-sans\">Mon</span>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-8 bg-[#2d3b23] text-[#eef2e8] text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity font-sans shadow-sm\">42</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Day 2 (Tue) -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 w-10 relative z-10 group\">\n                        <div class=\"relative w-8 h-[60px] bg-[#a1b887] rounded-full overflow-hidden transition-transform group-hover:scale-105 border border-[#b6cc9d]/20\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#3d4f2f] font-sans\">Tue</span>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-8 bg-[#2d3b23] text-[#eef2e8] text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity font-sans shadow-sm\">18</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Day 3 (Wed) - Active/Highlight -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 w-10 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"relative w-8 h-[160px] rounded-full flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 w-8 h-10 bg-[#2d3b23] rounded-t-full flex items-center justify-center z-20 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] border border-[#4f663c]\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[#eef2e8] text-xs font-medium mt-1 font-sans\">85</span>\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-1.5 border-l-4 border-r-4 border-b-[6px] border-transparent border-b-[#8DA374]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-[40%] bg-[#4f663c] z-10 mt-8 border-x border-[#b6cc9d]/20\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-[40%] rounded-b-full z-10 border-b border-x border-[#b6cc9d]/20\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent, transparent 4px, rgba(79, 102, 60, 0.4) 4px, rgba(79, 102, 60, 0.4) 8px);\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#a1b887] rounded-full z-0 mt-8 border border-[#b6cc9d]/20\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#1e2617] font-sans\">Wed</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Day 4 (Thu) -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 w-10 relative z-10 group\">\n                        <div class=\"relative w-8 h-[90px] bg-[#a1b887] rounded-full overflow-hidden transition-transform group-hover:scale-105 border border-[#b6cc9d]/20\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full h-[30%] bg-[#6a8752] rounded-b-full\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#3d4f2f] font-sans\">Thu</span>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-8 bg-[#2d3b23] text-[#eef2e8] text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity font-sans shadow-sm\">34</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Day 5 (Fri) -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 w-10 relative z-10 group\">\n                        <div class=\"relative w-8 h-[130px] bg-[#a1b887] rounded-full overflow-hidden transition-transform group-hover:scale-105 border border-[#b6cc9d]/20\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full h-[70%] bg-[#4f663c] rounded-b-full\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#3d4f2f] font-sans\">Fri</span>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-8 bg-[#2d3b23] text-[#eef2e8] text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity font-sans shadow-sm\">61</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. Text Animation Logic (Fade/Slide/Blur sequence) ---\n        function animateText(elementId) {\n            const el = document.getElementById(elementId);\n            if(!el) return;\n            const text = el.innerText;\n            el.innerHTML = '';\n            \n            const words = text.split(/\\s+/);\n            \n            words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                const span = document.createElement('span');\n                span.className = 'js-word-anim inline-block opacity-0 translate-y-2 blur-sm transition-all duration-500 ease-out';\n                span.style.transitionDelay = `${index * 80}ms`;\n                span.innerHTML = word + '&nbsp;';\n                el.appendChild(span);\n            });\n        }\n\n        animateText('title-anim');\n        \n        const masterTitle = document.getElementById('master-anim');\n        if(masterTitle) {\n            const lines = masterTitle.innerHTML.split('<br>');\n            masterTitle.innerHTML = '';\n            let globalWordIndex = 0;\n            \n            lines.forEach((line, lineIdx) => {\n                const cleanLine = line.trim();\n                if(cleanLine) {\n                    const words = cleanLine.split(/\\s+/);\n                    words.forEach((word) => {\n                        const span = document.createElement('span');\n                        span.className = 'js-word-anim inline-block opacity-0 translate-y-2 blur-sm transition-all duration-500 ease-out';\n                        span.style.transitionDelay = `${globalWordIndex * 100}ms`;\n                        span.innerHTML = word + '&nbsp;';\n                        masterTitle.appendChild(span);\n                        globalWordIndex++;\n                    });\n                }\n                if(lineIdx < lines.length - 1) {\n                    masterTitle.appendChild(document.createElement('br'));\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        // --- 2. Intersection Observer for Reveal ---\n        const observerOptions = {\n            root: null,\n            rootMargin: '0px',\n            threshold: 0.15\n        };\n\n        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer) => {\n            entries.forEach(entry => {\n                if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                    entry.target.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-4', 'blur-sm');\n                    entry.target.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0', 'blur-none');\n                    \n                    const words = entry.target.querySelectorAll('.js-word-anim');\n                    words.forEach(w => {\n                        w.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-2', 'blur-sm');\n                        w.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0', 'blur-none');\n                    });\n\n                    observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n                }\n            });\n        }, observerOptions);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.js-reveal').forEach(el => {\n            observer.observe(el);\n        });\n\n        // --- 3. Ethereal Utility Visualization (Canvas 2D Network Sphere) ---\n        function initNetworkGlobe() {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('network-globe');\n            if (!canvas) return;\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            \n            let width, height, centerX, centerY;\n            \n            function resize() {\n                const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n                canvas.width = rect.width * dpr;\n                canvas.height = rect.height * dpr;\n                width = canvas.width;\n                height = canvas.height;\n                centerX = width / 2;\n                centerY = height / 2;\n                ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n                width /= dpr;\n                height /= dpr;\n                centerX = width / 2;\n                centerY = height / 2;\n            }\n            \n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            // Spherical distribution\n            const nodes = [];\n            const numNodes = 130;\n            for(let i = 0; i < numNodes; i++) {\n                let phi = Math.acos(-1 + (2 * i) / numNodes);\n                let theta = Math.sqrt(numNodes * Math.PI) * phi;\n                nodes.push({\n                    x: Math.cos(theta) * Math.sin(phi),\n                    y: Math.sin(theta) * Math.sin(phi),\n                    z: Math.cos(phi),\n                    baseSize: Math.random() * 1.2 + 0.8,\n                    phase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2\n                });\n            }\n\n            const floatChip = document.getElementById('float-chip');\n            const floatCallout = document.getElementById('float-callout');\n\n            function draw(time) {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n                \n                const R = Math.min(width, height) * 0.45; \n                const angleY = time * 0.0003;\n                const driftY = Math.sin(time * 0.0005) * 15; // Vertical drift\n\n                const projectedNodes = nodes.map(n => {\n                    let xProj = n.x * Math.cos(angleY) + n.z * Math.sin(angleY);\n                    let zProj = -n.x * Math.sin(angleY) + n.z * Math.cos(angleY);\n                    return { ...n, xProj, zProj };\n                });\n\n                // Connections\n                ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                for(let i=0; i<projectedNodes.length; i++) {\n                    for(let j=i+1; j<projectedNodes.length; j++) {\n                        const n1 = projectedNodes[i];\n                        const n2 = projectedNodes[j];\n                        const dist = Math.hypot(n1.xProj - n2.xProj, n1.y - n2.y, n1.zProj - n2.zProj);\n                        \n                        if(dist < 0.4) {\n                            const avgZ = (n1.zProj + n2.zProj) / 2;\n                            if(avgZ > -0.6) {\n                                const alpha = Math.max(0, (1 - dist / 0.4)) * Math.min(1, (avgZ + 0.6) * 1.5) * 0.25;\n                                ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${alpha})`;\n                                ctx.beginPath();\n                                ctx.moveTo(centerX + n1.xProj * R, centerY + n1.y * R + driftY);\n                                ctx.lineTo(centerX + n2.xProj * R, centerY + n2.y * R + driftY);\n                                ctx.stroke();\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Nodes\n                projectedNodes.forEach(n => {\n                    const alpha = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (n.zProj + 0.5) * 1.5));\n                    if(alpha > 0) {\n                        const pulse = Math.sin(time * 0.002 + n.phase) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${alpha * (0.4 + pulse * 0.6)})`;\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.arc(centerX + n.xProj * R, centerY + n.y * R + driftY, n.baseSize * (1 + pulse * 0.3), 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                    }\n                });\n\n                // Update Floating Indicators based on spatial coordinates\n                const anchorNode1 = projectedNodes[10];\n                if(anchorNode1.zProj > 0) {\n                    floatChip.style.opacity = '1';\n                    floatChip.style.transform = `translate(${centerX + anchorNode1.xProj * R - 40}px, ${centerY + anchorNode1.y * R + driftY - 40}px)`;\n                } else {\n                    floatChip.style.opacity = '0';\n                }\n\n                const anchorNode2 = projectedNodes[45];\n                if(anchorNode2.zProj > 0.2) {\n                    floatCallout.style.opacity = '1';\n                    floatCallout.style.transform = `translate(${centerX + anchorNode2.xProj * R + 20}px, ${centerY + anchorNode2.y * R + driftY + 10}px)`;\n                } else {\n                    floatCallout.style.opacity = '0';\n                }\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n            }\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        setTimeout(initNetworkGlobe, 100);\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "eco-tech-dashboard.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/eco-tech-dashboard.jpg", "source_name": "eco-tech-dashboard-DESIGN.md", "views": 329, "forks": 12, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T07:07:48.066186+00:00"}